@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health check - 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Assignments - 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Create - 201, Location, received, updatedAt
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "HTTP-{{$guid}}",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/edusubmit/signalr"
}

### 4. Read case 3 - 200, received -> processing -> graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Missing fields - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Missing assignment - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "HTTP-001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/edusubmit/signalr"
}

### 7. Missing submission - 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. SignalR negotiate - 200 with connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Wrong hub URL - 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
